{"ref":"BDB, אָנֵף","hw":"אָנֵף","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָנֵף</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אָנַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. denom.</strong> from <span dir=\"rtl\">אַף</span> <strong>be angry (</strong>MI <em>id.</em>, cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَنِفَ</span>, Assyrian etc. in deriv.<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָנַפְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:3\" href=\"/Psalms.60.3\">ψ 60:3</a>, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶאֱנַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:12\" href=\"/Psalms.2.12\">ψ 2:12</a>, etc.;—<em>be angry</em>, of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; usually sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:46\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.46\">1 K 8:46</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:36\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.36\">2 Ch 6:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.1\">Is 12:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 85:6\" href=\"/Psalms.85.6\">ψ 85:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:14\" href=\"/Ezra.9.14\">Ezr 9:14</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:3\" href=\"/Psalms.60.3\">ψ 60:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:5\" href=\"/Psalms.79.5\">79:5</a>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:12\" href=\"/Psalms.2.12\">ψ 2:12</a>.<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  <strong> id.</strong> always sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, & alw. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְאַנַּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:37\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.37\">Dt 1:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.21\">4:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.20\">9:20</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְאַנַּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.8\">Dt 9:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.9\">1 K 11:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.18\">2 K 17:18</a>.","next":"BDB, אַף","prev":"BDB, אָנַס"}